# Celestial Prism costs two mana and tapping to add one mana of a chosen color (CR 605.1a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Island
Celestial Prism
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Celestial Prism.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Celestial Prism.Activate(Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Celestial Prism.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Celestial Prism.Tapped = true
Bot1.Mana = {R}
